     place the publisher is named at all, which is why it carries the mark. */
  .dcard__from {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-width: 0;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }
  /* Exactly `.dcard__pill`'s register — same size, same weight, same ink-soft.
