     rather than disappearing — it used to, on the theory that a second row of
     previews at the foot of a listing page was furniture nobody came for, but
     a title-and-two-lines card next to five others just like it turned "more
     like this" into a wall of text with no way to tell one from another at a
     glance. The artifact is still the fastest way to do that. */
  .dcard--compact .dcard__body {
